Z||000001||Standard||09-05-2000||03:23 PM||||IMHO, I don't think it looks quite right.  Take 'em off and paint them black, that should look pretty good.<P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 150,000 miles and counting!       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">    <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker||||reg||1
Z||000002||AkursedX||09-05-2000||04:46 PM||||I'd have to agree with Standard.  The rims do look nice, but the grey with the black ground effects look a little odd.  Paint the rims black and you got yourself one hell of a nice look automobile!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||3
